#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:5
msgid "Master element"
msgstr "主元件"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:7
msgid ""
"The master elements represent the devices from the command circuit such the "
"coil from a relay or contactor."
msgstr "主元件表示控制电路中的设备，例如继电器或接触器的线圈。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech master element"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 主元件"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:15
msgid ""
"For master element exist two type of variables, the general variables that "
"are common for all type of elements and managed internally by QElectroTech, "
"and the specific variables for this type of element."
msgstr "主元件有两种类型的变量：所有类型元件通用且由 QElectroTech 内部管理的一般变量，以及此类元件专用的特定变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:19
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining variable values from master element at the "
"**Selection properties** panel. QElectroTech does not allow defining new "
"variables. QElectroTech allows only displaying variables at dynamic texts "
"and define value of the specific variables."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许在 **Selection properties** 面板中定义主元件的变量值。QElectroTech "
"不允许定义新变量。QElectroTech 仅允许在动态文本中显示变量，并定义特定变量的值。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:25
msgid ""
"If the Selection properties panel is not displayed, it can be displayed from"
" **Settings > Display > Selection properties**."
msgstr ""
"如果 Selection properties 面板未显示，可以从 **Settings > Display > Selection "
"properties** 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:27
msgid "General variables"
msgstr "一般变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:29
msgid "**% {F}**: Label from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {F}**: 元件所在图幅的标签"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:30
msgid "**% {f}**: Number from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {f}**: 元件所在图幅的编号"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:31
msgid ""
"**% {M}**: Plant variable from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {M}**: 元件所在图幅的设备变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:32
msgid ""
"**% {LM}**: Location variable of the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {LM}**: 元件所在图幅的位置变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:33
msgid ""
"**% {l}**: Folio line number from the workspace where the element can be "
"found"
msgstr "**% {l}**: 元件所在工作区中图幅的行号"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:34
msgid ""
"**% {c}**: Folio column number from the workspace where the element can be "
"found"
msgstr "**% {c}**: 元件所在工作区中图幅的列号"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:35
msgid "**% {id}**: Folio position in the project (Schema number)"
msgstr "**% {id}**: 图幅在项目中的位置（原理图编号）"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:37
msgid "Specific variables"
msgstr "具体变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Label formula**: Definition of the formula which defines the **Label** "
"value. If a auto numbering pattern is selected during terminal creation, "
"QElectroTech defines ``%autnum`` as default formula."
msgstr ""
"**Label formula**: 定义 **Label** 值的公式。如果在创建端子时选择了自动编号模式，QElectroTech 会将 "
"``%autnum`` 设为默认公式。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_master.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Label**: Internal variable which is used to defines the element code."
msgstr "**Label**: 内部变量，用于定义元件代码。"

